verses.8:
“He trusts in the LORD,
 let the LORD deliver him;
 let the LORD rescue him,
 since He delights in him.” + 22:8 Cited in Matthew 27:43|MAT 27:43

verses.16:
For dogs surround me;
 a band of evil men encircles me;
 they have pierced my hands and feet. + 22:16 DSS, LXX, Vulgate, and Syriac; most MT like a lion at my hands and feet

verses.26:
The poor will eat and be satisfied;
 those who seek the LORD will praise Him.
 May your hearts live forever!

verses.29:
All the rich of the earth will feast and worship;
 all who go down to the dust will kneel before Him—
 even those unable to preserve their lives.
